<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>50cc Scooter Weekly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>A week on a 50cc scooter in Hanoi starts from one verified number: 200,000 VND per day, the only published 50cc figure. This guide plans a seven-day 50cc stay around that number honestly, because the 50cc has no published weekly rate, and the weekly terms for this class come from the desk as a quote, not from an estimate.</p>
<p>We cover how a week of daily 50cc rates adds up, why the 50cc breaks the pattern the other models follow, what a quoted week should be checked for at the counter, how the published weekly rates of other models anchor a comparison, and the deposit, gear and support questions a week adds. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">What is verified and what is not</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">A week at the daily rate</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Why the 50cc is different</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Asking for a quoted week</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Published weekly rates across the fleet</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">A week of 50cc riding in Hanoi</a></li>
